WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.797
Before the service, put your announcements in a group.

2
00:00:04.897 --> 00:00:10.624
Press Loop under the group's name, and its slides advance by themselves.

3
00:00:10.724 --> 00:00:16.260
A thin bar along the bottom shows the time left on each slide.

4
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.027
Press Loop again to stop.
